 Next.js, Electron, TypeScript, SCSS, Node.js/Express, Prisma ORM, Sanity CMS, Storybook,\\nGSAP, Cypress, Jest, React Testing Library, GitHub Actions, ESLint, Prettier, localization & accessibility tools.", "semantic": "role_header", "paragraph_profile": {"bold": false, "italic": false, "alignment": null, "font_name": "Calibri", "font_size_pt": 11.0, "indent_left_pt": 28.5, "space_after_pt": 0.0, "space_before_pt": 12.808135986328125}}, {"text": "Software Engineer (Contract) | PartsTrader Markets Ltd. | Wellington, NZ | 2024 – 2025\\n- Developed a dedicated .NET microservice to interface with a legacy API and built a modern, responsive front-end\\nusing React withTypeScript.\\n- Translated Figma UI designs into dynamic, accessible interfaces using React, TypeScript, and styled-components.\\n- Applied Domain-Driven Design principles by structuring the microservice with Repository, Domain Model,\\nMapper, and Application Service patterns.\\n- Technologies: .NET service layer, React, TypeScript, Cypress, GitHub Actions, domain-driven design patterns.", "semantic": "role_header", "paragraph_profile": {"bold": false, "italic": false, "alignment": null, "font_name": "Calibri", "font_size_pt": 11.0, "indent_left_pt": 28.5, "space_after_pt": 0.0, "space_before_pt": 12.441925048828125}}, {"text": "Software Engineer & Founder | Habitual Genesis | Remote | 2016 – Present\\n- Partner with authors, museums, and education nonprofits to ship low-maintenance digital products.\\n- Delivered discovery-through-launch engagements while keeping ongoing costs low.\\n- Stayed lean by embedding with stakeholders to clarify needs, prioritise MVPs, and trial marketing ideas without\\nraising spend.​\\n- Various projects with General Assembly, Thinkful, Codecademy, and others\\n- Technologies: JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap, GitHub, GitHub Pages, Squarespace, Mailchimp, Google Drive.", "semantic": "role_header", "paragraph_profile": {"bold": false, "italic": false, "alignment": null, "fo