ment.\\n- Built a mock interview app for students, exponentially increasing career services' capacity to give feedback.\\n- Technologies: ReactJS, JavaScript, jQuery, Mocha, Chai, HTML, CSS3, SASS/SCSS, PostgreSQL, MySQL, Git,\\nGitHub, Heroku, bash, zsh.", "semantic": "role_header", "paragraph_profile": {"bold": false, "italic": false, "alignment": null, "font_name": "Calibri", "font_size_pt": 11.0, "indent_left_pt": 0.0, "space_after_pt": 0.0, "space_before_pt": 11.94189453125}}, {"text": "Software Engineer (Contract) | Bypass Mobile | Austin, TX | 2016 – 2016\\n- Designed and developed a JSON-API spec product licensing platform using Ruby on Rails as part of a small team.\\n- Technologies: JSON-API, Ruby on Rails, ActiveRecord, RSpec, MySQL, Git, GitHub, Vagrant, bash, JIRA.", "semantic": "role_header", "paragraph_profile": {"bold": false, "italic": false, "alignment": null, "font_name": "Calibri", "font_size_pt": 11.0, "indent_left_pt": 0.0, "space_after_pt": 0.0, "space_before_pt": 12.44189453125}}, {"text": "Software Engineer | Union Metrics | Austin, TX | 2014 – 2016\\n- Migrated and refactored two legacy codebases to use Rails 4, improving maintainability, security of core business\\nfeatures, and performance by 20%.\\n- Created a knowledge base of 100 most common customer technical challenges, reducing resolution time by 50%.\\n- Technologies: JavaScript, Ruby on Rails, ActiveRecord, RSpec, jQuery, HTML, CSS3, SASS/SCSS, MySQL, Git, GitHub,\\nVagrant, Jenkins, bash.", "semantic": "role_header", "paragraph_profile": {"bold": false, "italic": false, "alignment": null, "font_name": "Calibri", "font_size_pt": 11.0, "indent_left_pt": 0.0, "space_after_pt": 0.0, "space_before_pt": 12.4420166015625}}, {"text": "EDUCATION", "semantic": "paragraph", "paragraph_profile": {"bold": true, "italic": false, "alignment": null, "font_name": "Calibri-Bold", "font_size_pt": 13.0, "indent_left_pt": 0.0, "space_after_pt": 0.0, "space_before_pt": 14.6331787109375}}, {"text": "Postgraduate Diploma in Information Technology | Whitireia and WelTec, New Zealand\\nFull-Stack Web Development, Ruby on Rails, and JavaScript Certification | Dev Bootcamp\\nBS in Business Administration, Entrepreneurship, & International Business | Chapman University", "semantic": "role_header", "paragraph_profile": {"bold": false, "italic": false, "alignment": null, "font_name": "Calibri-Bold", "font_size_pt": 11.0, "indent_left_pt": 0.0, "space_after_pt": 0.0, "space_before_pt": 7.4129638671875}}], "semantic_type": "experience"}, {"roles": [], "title": "ADDITIONAL INFORMATION", "heading": {"text": "ADDITIONAL INFORMATION", "semantic": "section_heading", "paragraph_profile": {"bold": true, "italic": false, "alignment": null, "font_name": "Calibri-Bold", "font_size_pt": 13.0, "indent_left_pt": 0.0, "space_after_pt": 0.0, "space_before_pt": 9.88330078125}}, "body_paras": [{"text": "For more details, you can find answers to common hiring questions, my references, and a detailed list of my skills\\nand experience at the following links:\\n- Common Hiring Questions: github.com/olitreadwell/resume/blob/main/common-hiring-questions.md\\n- Portfolio Projects: https://github.com/olitreadwell/resume/blob/main/portfolio-projects.md\\n- Professional References: github.com/olitreadwell/resume/blob/main/linkedin-recommendations.md\\n- Skills and Experience: github.com/olitreadwell/resume/blob/main/skills-and-experience.md", "semantic": "paragraph", "paragraph_profile": {"bold": false, "italic": false, "alignment": null, "font_name": "Calibri", "font_size_pt": 11.0, "indent_left_pt": 0.0, "space_after_pt": 0.0, "space_before_pt": 5.5499267578125}}], "semantic_type": "other"}], "source_kind": "pdf", "header_paras": [{"text": "Oli Treadwell\\nSenior Software Engineer", "semantic": "paragraph", "paragraph_profile": {"bold": false, "italic": false, "alignment": null, "font_name": "Calibri", "font_size_pt": 2.2, "indent_left_pt": 28.5, "space_after_pt": 0.0, "space_before_pt": 0.49658203125}}, {"text": "olitreadwell@gmail.com | +64 22 451 9939 (Text first please)\\nlinkedin.com/in/olitreadwell | github.com/olitreadwell | Book a Call", "semantic": "role_header", "paragraph_profile": {"bold": false, "italic": false, "alignment": null, "font_name": "Calibri", "font_size_pt": 11.0, "indent_left_pt": 233.78195190429688, "space_after_pt": 0.0, "space_before_pt": 0.0}}, {"text": "SUMMARY\\nSenior Software Engineer with 10+ years of expertise using modern web development technologies. Proven ability\\nto build accessible and user-friendly interfaces, collaborate effectively within teams, and deliver high-quality code.\\nSeeking software engineering roles at any level.", "semantic": "paragraph", "paragraph_profile": {"bold": false, "italic": false, "alignment": null, "font_name": "Calibri-Bold", "font_size_pt": 11.0, "indent_left_pt": 28.5, "space_after_pt": 0.0, "space_before_pt": 6.96148681640625}}, {"text": "SKILLS\\n- Frontend & UX: React, TypeScript, Next.js, Storybook, CSS/SCSS, Design systems, Localisation\\n- Backend & APIs: Node.js, .NET, Ruby on Rails, Python Flask,  GraphQL, REST/JSON:API, Schema design\\n- DevOps & Tooling: AWS, Docker, GitHub Actions, CircleCI, Cypress, Jest/React Testing Library (RTL), Monitoring\\n- Leadership & Accessibility: Technical mentoring, Stakeholder facilitation, Accessibility advocacy,", "semantic": "paragraph", "paragraph_profile": {"bold": false, "italic": false, "alignment": null, "font_name": "Calibri", "font_size_pt": 11.0, "indent_left_pt": 28.5, "space_after_pt": 0.0, "space_before_pt": 9.88330078125}}]}
