quirements.\\n\\nMy background includes architecting horizontally scaled trading servers, implementing multi-layer caching and database read replica strategies, and leveraging asynchronous messaging to decouple services and improve throughput. I have also contributed as an independent contractor to world-leading AI labs, training and evaluating advanced LLMs on complex software engineering problems—experience that keeps me current with AI/ML workflows and generative AI integration in engineering contexts.\\n\\nI am passionate about building intelligent, reliable systems at scale and mentoring engineers to achieve operational excellence. I look forward to contributing my distributed systems expertise, hands-on AI/ML experience, and commitment to delivery quality to Amazon's Middle Mile Transportation Technology team.\\n\\nThank you for your consideration.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nLeonid Verman\\n"}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026-03-11 01:22:03.476956+00
