ineer with 10+ years of experience building modern web applications, with a focus on React/TypeScript UI architecture, accessible front-end engineering, and full-stack delivery with Node.js and relational databases.\\n\\nAcross product teams, I’ve led and contributed to initiatives that align closely with CARFAX’s Account Engineering mission: creating consistent, high-quality customer-facing experiences. At WorkTango, I re-architected a Rewards platform UI from Rails-rendered views to ReactJS and helped implement a modular design system to improve UI consistency; this work was associated with a 15% increase in customer engagement. More recently at Numeral Studio, I’ve delivered reusable React/TypeScript components (including Electron-based UI) with Jest/React Testing Library coverage, and built React interfaces alongside Node/Express services for HR case workflows.\\n\\nAs a team lead, I bring hands-on leadership practices that match how CARFAX describes the role: delegating ownership, using code review as a coaching tool, and supporting engineers through complicated technical problems without relying on “superhero” execution. I’m also comfortable collaborating in cross-functional environments with Product and Design (including Figma/Zeplin handoffs) while keeping quality high through testing and CI.\\n\\nI’d welcome the opportunity to help CARFAX deliver secure, consistent, and user-friendly account experiences and shared front-end components across your products. Thank you for your time and consideration.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nOli Treadwell"}	documents/fe1493e3-80d2-4396-8138-c586c9ecef81/generated/9ae7b8bd-fed1-44df-9c61-bd87c1f1543c/resume.docx	documents/fe1493e3-80d2-4396-8138-c586c9ecef81/generated/9ae7b8bd-fed1-44df-9c61-bd87c1f1543c/resume.pdf	documents/fe1493e3-80d2-4396-8138-c586c9ecef81/generated/9ae7b8bd-fed1-44df-9c61-bd87c1f1543c/cover_letter.docx	documents/fe1493e3-80d2-4396-8138-c586c9ecef81/generated/9ae7b8bd-fed1-44df-9c61-bd87c1f1543c/cover_letter.pdf