asks. In parallel, I’ve integrated AI tools (ChatGPT, Cursor AI; also Claude and the OpenAI API in my tooling practice) into engineering workflows to accelerate prototyping and troubleshooting while keeping engineers accountable for correctness—an approach that aligns with Boam AI’s emphasis on fast iteration and high standards.\\n\\nBoam AI’s focus on turning messy signals into reliable, always up-to-date intelligence resonates with how I’ve built and shipped correctness-sensitive systems where customers depend on the output daily. I’d welcome the chance to partner closely with your CEO, data, engineering, and ML teams to turn customer pull into crisp specs, tight sequencing, and shipped outcomes.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nLeonid Verman\\n"}	\N	\N	documents/27af6204-a05d-4fc9-8115-a1df26c83ebd/generated/0aa9fcda-1f72-409a-899a-5102b9b5b187/cover_letter.docx	documents/27af6204-a05d-4fc9-8115-a1df26c83ebd/generated/0aa9fcda-1f72-409a-899a-5102b9b5b187/cover_letter.pdf	2026-03-18 06:48:56.614168+00
