 Software Engineer – Team Lead role at CARFAX. I’m a Senior Software Engineer with 10+ years building modern web applications, with a focus on accessible, user-friendly front-end architecture in React + TypeScript and pragmatic full-stack delivery with Node.js and Rails.\\n\\nAcross product environments, I’ve leaned on component-driven UI engineering to keep experiences consistent and maintainable. At WorkTango (formerly KazooHR), I re-architected the Rewards platform UI from Rails-rendered views to ReactJS and helped implement a modular design system, supporting a measurable increase in customer engagement. More recently at Numeral Studio, I’ve delivered reusable React/TypeScript components (with Jest/React Testing Library coverage) and built React interfaces alongside Node/Express services for HR case workflows, with automated linting/formatting and unit-test checks to keep quality high.\\n\\nThe CARFAX Account Engineering mission—delivering a secure, consistent login/sign-up and profile experience—maps well to the kind of high-use, customer-facing UI work I’ve done, especially where disciplined testing, design-system reuse, and cross-functional collaboration matter. I also enjoy the team-lead aspects of the role: delegating ownership, mentoring through code review and coaching, and pushing back on risky changes that could threaten production stability.\\n\\nI’d welcome the chance to bring this mix of UI architecture, full-stack execution, and hands-on mentorship to CARFAX in London, ON. Thank you for your time and consideration.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nOli Treadwell\\n"}	\N	\N	documents/fe1493e3-80d2-4396-8138-c586c9ecef81/generated/d4c1237f-57f0-498c-b976-01e87f6e5d00/cover_letter.docx	documents/fe1493e3-80d2-4396-8138-c586c9ecef81/generated/d4c1237f-57f0-498c-b976-01e87f6e5d00/cover_letter.pdf	2026-03-18 08:32:29.033987+00
